msgctxt "129\t195"
msgid "Date!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180\t247"
msgid "What're you doing!?\\nLet her go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "306\t356"
msgid "Don't move!"
msgstr "Non muoverti!"

msgctxt "357\t417"
msgid "Or she gets it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "509\t654"
msgid "Feeling a little nostalgic?\\nOr perhaps a bit of deja vu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "655\t797"
msgid ""
"Ironic, ain't it? Bumping off a cop and\\nhis superior officer in the very "
"same spot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "875\t1005"
msgid ""
"I admit I botched things up back then,\\nbut you won't be so lucky this "
"time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1018\t1132"
msgid "I'll put bullets in every single one of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1139\t1249"
msgid "So, who wants to go first?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1260\t1320"
msgid "Tsukishima."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1327\t1388"
msgid "I won't let you pull the same trick twice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1389\t1442"
msgid "Excuse me?"
msgstr "Mi scusi?"

msgctxt "1443\t1505"
msgid "Listen, Mama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1518\t1609"
msgid "I don't mean to speak ill of the dead..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1610\t1672"
msgid "But Keisuke shouldn't have hesitated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1730\t1808"
msgid "If there's someone that's really\\nprecious to you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1809\t1960"
msgid ""
"Then you have to do whatever it takes\\nto protect them. There's no running "
"from that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1987\t2215"
msgid ""
"Otherwise, all you'll end up doing is leaving\\nbehind regrets. For yourself"
" and your loved ones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2237\t2297"
msgid "Date-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2314\t2396"
msgid "You've always been precious to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2404\t2541"
msgid "And I protect what's precious to me,\\nno matter what I have to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2568\t2631"
msgid "I've always prided myself on that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2636\t2732"
msgid "So... That's how I'm gonna end this situation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2733\t2830"
msgid "I'll end you first, Date!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3195\t3255"
msgid "Mama..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3287\t3347"
msgid "Date-san..."
msgstr ""
